# observer.rules - fsfo/observer.sh setup|start|stop|restart
Enter wallet password \(used to protect the wallet\):	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Confirm wallet password:	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Enter existing wallet password:	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Enter password for [^:\n]*:	@OBSERVER_PASSWORD@	secret
Do you want to recreate the wallet\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	y
Add/update credentials in existing wallet\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	y
Type 'RECREATE WALLET' to continue:	RECREATE WALLET
Point WALLET_LOCATION at [^\n]*\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	y
